  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Shared purple and navy operational workspace",
    "overview": "Retain the existing workspace identity: a navy header, cyan-to-purple layered mark, purple actions, and white bordered surfaces on a quiet canvas. Dense tables and evidence forms stay readable through clear headings, restrained support text, and visible interaction states.\n\nThis records the implemented shared system after the frontend refinement. It does not introduce a new brand or page strategy. Frontmatter defines the reusable primitives; `frontend/src/styles.css` and the shared UI components remain implementation evidence. Some scoped legacy treatments remain, as described below.",
